      "claim": "The average biparietal width (side-to-side diameter) of an adult human skull is approximately 140 mm (14 cm).",
      "evidence": "Anthropometric data from forensic and medical literature (e.g., White & Folkens, 2005) indicate mean adult skull width is ~140 mm.",
